# The second output put left of and above the main one on システム環境設定's 画面サイズ page
# (docs/tessronos 10.4.8, 10.4.10), for tools/ui_run.py with UI_SCREENS=2 (QEMU's second
# bochs-display, 1024 x 800, right of the first at start). The parts are where
# ui_screens_out.steps says; the side's pop-up opens with the row chosen over the part, a row
# 20 high (右, 下, 左, 上). With the second screen left of the main one, the main screen and the
# window on it are 1024 further right; with it above, 800 further down. The desktop's question
# is answered with Enter to keep what was set.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 206 181
wait 300
click 706 184
expect sysenv: screen page 1280x800
wait 500
click 290 157
wait 300
click 290 177
expect output 2 of 2
wait 500
# left of the main one
logmark
click 670 157
wait 300
click 670 197
wait 300
click 706 554
wait 1500
key 28
expect sysenv: screen OUT1 on
expectsincein 30 left 0
wait 800
win システム環境設定
shot sl_left
# above it: the window is 1024 further right now
logmark
click 1694 157
wait 300
click 1694 177
wait 300
click 1730 554
wait 1500
key 28
expectsincein 30 above 0
wait 800
win システム環境設定
shot sl_above
# and right of it again: the window is 800 further down now
logmark
click 670 957
wait 300
click 670 897
wait 300
click 706 1354
wait 1500
key 28
expectsincein 30 right 0
wait 800
win システム環境設定
shot sl_right
